---
/*
 * Stages of Production Diagram
 *
 * Stage 1: MP > AP
 * Stage 2: 0 < MP < AP
 * Stage 3: MP < 0
 */
---

<figure id="stages-of-production-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 620 420"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="stages-title stages-description"
  >
    <title id="stages-title">Stages of Production</title>

    <desc id="stages-description">
      Diagram showing three stages of production based on the relationship
      between marginal product and average product.
    </desc>

    <!-- Axes -->
    <line class="axis" x1="70" y1="35" x2="70" y2="350"></line>
    <line class="axis" x1="70" y1="350" x2="570" y2="350"></line>

    <!-- Axis labels -->
    <text class="axis-label" x="70" y="22" text-anchor="middle"> Product </text>

    <text class="axis-label" x="570" y="380" text-anchor="end">
      Variable Input
    </text>

    <!-- Stage boundary lines -->
    <line class="boundary" x1="235" y1="55" x2="235" y2="350"></line>
    <line class="boundary" x1="415" y1="55" x2="415" y2="350"></line>

    <!-- Stage 1 -->
    <text class="stage-label" x="150" y="75" text-anchor="middle">
      Stage 1
    </text>

    <text class="stage-description" x="150" y="94" text-anchor="middle">
      MP &gt; AP
    </text>

    <!-- Stage 2 -->
    <text class="stage-label" x="325" y="75" text-anchor="middle">
      Stage 2
    </text>

    <text class="stage-description" x="325" y="94" text-anchor="middle">
      0 &lt; MP &lt; AP
    </text>

    <!-- Stage 3 -->
    <text class="stage-label" x="492" y="75" text-anchor="middle">
      Stage 3
    </text>

    <text class="stage-description" x="492" y="94" text-anchor="middle">
      MP &lt; 0
    </text>

    <!-- AP curve -->
    <path
      class="ap-curve"
      d="
        M 80 285
        C 125 230, 170 150, 235 125
        C 285 105, 340 120, 415 170
        C 470 205, 520 245, 560 275
      "
    ></path>

    <!-- MP curve -->
    <path
      class="mp-curve"
      d="
        M 80 310
        C 120 175, 165 95, 210 115
        C 250 135, 285 190, 330 230
        C 370 265, 405 305, 440 325
        C 485 345, 525 355, 560 360
      "
    ></path>

    <!-- Zero line -->
    <line class="zero-line" x1="70" y1="325" x2="570" y2="325"></line>

    <!-- Curve labels -->
    <text class="ap-label" x="205" y="110"> AP </text>

    <text class="mp-label" x="175" y="92"> MP </text>
  </svg>

  <figcaption>
    The three stages of production are determined by the relationship between <strong
      >MP</strong
    > and <strong>AP</strong>. Stage 2 is the economically relevant stage
    because MP is positive but below AP.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  #stages-of-production-diagram {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 28px auto;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .axis {
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .boundary {
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .zero-line {
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .axis-label {
    fill: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .stage-label {
    fill: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .stage-description {
    fill: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .ap-curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--s5);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .mp-curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dia-pt);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .ap-label {
    fill: var(--s5);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram .mp-label {
    fill: var(--dia-pt);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  #stages-of-production-diagram figcaption strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
